---
import { vibaryHighlights, vibaryLinks } from "../../data/desktop";
---

<div class="os-window__scroll">
  <div class="vibary">
    <section class="vibary__hero">
      <img class="vibary__logo" src="/icons/vibary.png" alt="Vibary logo" />
      <div class="vibary__copy">
        <span class="vibary__eyebrow">A Library of Book Vibes</span>
        <h2>把一本书做成可以进入的阅读界面</h2>
        <p>
          Vibary 更像一个面向作品世界的阅读入口，而不是普通书单页。官网展示里，书被整理成章节、人物、
          主题与交互片段，让阅读更像进入一个有结构的空间。
        </p>
        <div class="vibary__actions">
          <a href={vibaryLinks.home} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Website</a>
          <a href={vibaryLinks.threeBody} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Three-Body</a>
          <a href={vibaryLinks.systemsThinking} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Thinking, Fast and Slow</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="vibary__source">
      <div class="vibary__source-card">
        <strong>From the official site</strong>
        <span>A Library of Book Vibes.</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="vibary__grid">
      {vibaryHighlights.map((item) => (
        <article class="vibary__card">
          <h3>{item.title}</h3>
          <p>{item.note}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
      <article class="vibary__card vibary__card--wide">
        <h3>Explore</h3>
        <p>
          除了首页，官网里还能看到作品页、故事页和分章节路径。整体更像把“读书”重新包装成一个适合漫游和停留的产品。
        </p>
        <a href={vibaryLinks.story} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open story view</a>
      </article>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
